        "Plasticized structure is destroyed, connection leaking",
        "Only join axially, use marking as a check"
      ],
      [
        "Missing deburring/chamfering",
        "Material pushes up, joining zone becomes uneven",
        "Deburr every cut, tool is part of the system"
      ],
      [
        "Dirty heating element",
        "Adhesions burn and become embedded in the seam",
        "Clean heating surfaces with a lint-free cloth before each weld"
      ],
      [
        "Premature loading",
        "Seam deforms before solidifying",
        "Observe cooling times, 8 minutes for d110"
      ],
      [
